    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And these",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are the countries",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which the children of Israel inherited in the land of Canaan, which Eleazar the priest, and Joshua the son of Nun, and the heads of the fathers of the tribes of the children of Israel, distributed for inheritance to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By lot",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their inheritance, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded by the hand of Moses, for the nine tribes, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the half tribe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For Moses had given the inheritance of two tribes and an half tribe on the other side Jordan: but unto the Levites he gave none inheritance among them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the children of Joseph were two tribes, Manasseh and Ephraim: therefore they gave no part unto the Levites in the land, save cities to dwell",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", with their suburbs for their cattle and for their substance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "commanded Moses, so the children of Israel did, and they divided the land.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Then the children of Judah came unto Joshua in Gilgal: and Caleb the son of Jephunneh the Kenezite said unto him, Thou knowest the thing that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Moses the man of God concerning me and thee in Kadesh-barnea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Forty years old",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I when Moses the servant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sent me from Kadesh-barnea to espy out the land; and I brought him word again as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in mine heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless my brethren that went up with me made the heart of the people melt: but I wholly followed the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses sware on that day, saying, Surely the land whereon thy feet have trodden shall be thine inheritance, and thy children's for ever, because thou hast wholly followed the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And now, behold, the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath kept me alive, as he said, these forty and five years, even since the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake this word unto Moses, while",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the children of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel wandered in the wilderness: and now, lo, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this day fourscore and five years old.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As yet I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "strong this day as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "I was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the day that Moses sent me: as my strength",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then, even so",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my strength now, for war, both to go out, and to come in.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore give me this mountain, whereof the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake in that day; for thou heardest in that day how the Anakims",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "there, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the cities",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fenced: if so be the",
